  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "大坪頂、小港，我ê愛"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>謝函傑</b></span></p><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hit時王梨園拄ta̋ⁿ pháng塗　阿祖伊沃肥飼塗肉</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">紅日頭kā伊ê kha-chiah-phiaⁿ曝kah拚重汗</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿祖講「林少貓死--ah！去hō͘紅日頭曝--死--ê！」</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī阮兜王梨園hia koh-khah過--leh</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hit時王梨園拄ta̋ⁿ pháng塗</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hiàng-chūn王梨栽仔拄ta̋ⁿ插--loeh　幼chíⁿ幼chíⁿ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">聽人講港口有兵仔船靠岸</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">穿草鞋　夯pún擔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">紅日頭beh落山</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿公kap阿媽ná拭汗ná叫王梨sī-sōa大！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">白日頭koh-khah刺chha̍k　in料想bōe到</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">汗繼續流</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hiàng-chūn王梨栽仔拄ta̋ⁿ插--loeh</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hit站王梨欉leh吐紅（thò͘-hông）　紅gê仔紅gê</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">煉油廠ê鐵厝拄leh搭</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">厝鳥仔lóng飛去tah？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">甘蔗ha̍h iáu未拆　lu塗機仔就來--ah！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿母講工廠若起好　阿pâ chiah有好頭路　lán chia就有好發展</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hit站王梨欉leh吐紅</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">面前日頭sio-siāng hiah炎</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">王梨欉ui-ui lian-lian　kiōng-beh臭ta</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">工業區ê khőng-pé-á kap大枝煙筒　暝日lóng teh pháng</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大林蒲、鳳鼻頭ê海雞母　lóng hông hiàm走--tah ！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">天頂phú色ê雲　kâm阮chia ê目屎--tah</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">滴tī怪手thún踏ê ta塗</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">面前王梨kiōng-beh臭ta</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">總--是心愛ê家鄉　我m̄甘看伊受拖磨</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ba̋ng驚日頭gōa-ní炎　thí一枝傘來遮</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Chhōa我tńg--來--lah　家鄉ê鳥仔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tah iáu是lán搧風ê所在</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Chia是小港！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有港口kâm水ê海風　mā有熱情大pān ê khùi口</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">將來　王梨bōe koh再lian-lian</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">In ē繼續大　繼續大！</span></p><div><br /></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><b>作者導讀：</b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\">我ê家鄉——小港大坪頂（Tōa-pîⁿ-téng），是一个好徛起、好種作ê所在，ùi日本時代，chit tah lóng是種王梨leh討趁--ê，ē-sái講王梨就是大坪頂chit 100～200冬歷史ê見證者。見證反抗日本殖民ê林少貓tī阮chia後山hông刣--死，見證大坪頂人tī困苦ê日子，giám硬ê精神，kah滴落塗ê血汗。Koh sòa--loeh，台灣人猶原等無出頭hit一工，大坪頂人mā sio-siāng。想講換政府--ah，總算日子beh好過--ah！Hō͘人料想bōe到--ê，是「chhoah尿換滲屎」，日子仝款歹過，「汗繼續流」。</div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\">Koh-khah hō͘人心疼--ê，是kā台電發電廠、台船、中油、中鋼一寡汙染性chiâⁿ重ê工業區無講無tàⁿ就設tī chia，「暝日lóng leh pháng ê大枝煙筒」，歹味ê空氣，hō͘小港已經有400冬討海歷史ê庄頭：大林蒲、鳳鼻頭，姑不終soah ài來搬離開心愛ê土地kah港口，已經蹛幾若代ê厝，哪ē是講拆就ē-sái拆--tah？Bōe輸「乞食趕廟公」，「大林蒲、鳳鼻頭ê海雞母　lóng hông hiàm走--tah！」</div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\">雖然伊受盡痛苦，m̄-kú iáu是我心愛ê土地kah鄉親，我m̄甘就án-ne離開--in，我beh「thí一枝傘來遮」。將來，我希望畢業了後，ē-tàng tńg--去，疼thàng io飼我ê土地，看顧鄉親ê身體，用我ê醫學專業照顧逐家ê健康kap in幼膩樸實ê心。</div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\">Chit首詩，獻hō͘我心愛ê大林蒲、大坪頂kap小港！</div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><b>（作者是成功大學醫學系三年ê學生）</b></div><div><br /></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiE4O_Jy99joe5ECXoAR1DuMXEbntujRjjZ1L6ZRyBLk8vGQFGYWIN4xKfUODgSKTbexICUTztu4taCsBKSU3qyKd-WptX8HXXmA0jNyE6gzmFgV5meOiWaobtip_zs0m9jOA6O5T6uqKlPFTUd70YviL8i32bll-yyvGiPJGeCYpmOrVWxuFISbi_m1A/s1424/341%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiE4O_Jy99joe5ECXoAR1DuMXEbntujRjjZ1L6ZRyBLk8vGQFGYWIN4xKfUODgSKTbexICUTztu4taCsBKSU3qyKd-WptX8HXXmA0jNyE6gzmFgV5meOiWaobtip_zs0m9jOA6O5T6uqKlPFTUd70YviL8i32bll-yyvGiPJGeCYpmOrVWxuFISbi_m1A/w450-h640/341%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEik5zT3JsKlSIZQLx79Ainm56B5yKAqggoKriP4_WTvR7Qd13g5GDS93RWlOdB3BZhacbNTXjyLU1ClQkrkyklHQhLCm07m_ycPwbB_xC0nTPsaz45C8byJqrLWtTrzceKXsPZ92aYhwqXh1W-qw1RSK8TIsnLCceykqFn7OJX1K712Ic8NLZ9P9cq8Jw/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E